:"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"a355c438-db0e-11ef-ac4e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"目下參佐，言其近在眼前也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"目下参佐，言其近在眼前也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a355c43a-db0e-11ef-b929-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"燕王","people_name_jianti_auto":"燕王","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"a355c43c-db0e-11ef-9c31-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"垂","people_name_jianti_auto":"垂","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"a355c43d-db0e-11ef-a72b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a355c43e-db0e-11ef-81b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙國","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵国","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a355c43f-db0e-11ef-a16c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"趙北，趙國以北也。假署者，權時以假版署置其官，未以白燕王垂也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"赵北，赵国以北也。假署者，权时以假版署置其官，未以白燕王垂也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"a355c43b-db0e-11ef-bc15-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_setup","source_end_index":8,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"爲後邃等迎農張本","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a3580e03-db0e-11ef-b417-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"邃","people_name_jianti_auto":"邃","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a355c441-db0e-11ef-81a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"農","people_name_jianti_auto":"农","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a355c442-db0e-11ef-b437-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲後邃等迎農張本。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为后邃等迎农张本。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"a355c440-db0e-11ef-b1e7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"a355c42f-db0e-11ef-ad91-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"suī","source_anchor_text":"從事中郎眭邃近出違","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":10,"text":"眭","tongjian_id":"44667bf7-a751-5fbe-8e3b-d6da1decce68"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"高邑","resolved_place_entity_id":3494,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a355c444-db0e-11ef-a709-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"農至高邑，遣從事中郞眭邃近出，違期不還。長史張攀言於農曰：「邃目下參佐，敢欺罔不還，請回軍討之。」農不應，敕備假版，以邃爲高陽太守，參佐家在趙北者，悉假署遣歸。凡舉補太守三人，長史二十餘人，退謂攀曰：「君所見殊誤，當今豈可自相魚肉！俟吾北還，邃等自當迎於道左，君但觀之。」","content_fanyi":"慕容农到达高邑，派从事中郎眭邃到附近外出，过了期限仍未返回。长史张攀对慕容农说：“眭邃是您身边的参佐，胆敢欺骗蒙蔽，逾期不归，请回军讨伐他。”慕容农没有答应，下令准备假借国主名义颁行的任命文书，任命眭邃为高阳太守；凡家在赵地以北的参佐僚属，全都暂授官职遣送回去。总共选拔补任了太守三人、长史二十多人。退下后，慕容农对张攀说：“你的看法非常错误，当今这种时候，怎么能自己人互相残杀！等我从北边回来时，眭邃等人自然会夹道欢迎，你只管看着好了。”","content_jianti_auto":"农至高邑，遣从事中郞眭邃近出，违期不还。长史张攀言于农曰：「邃目下参佐，敢欺罔不还，请回军讨之。」农不应，敕备假版，以邃为高阳太守，参佐家在赵北者，悉假署遣归。凡举补太守三人，长史二十余人，退谓攀曰：「君所见殊误，当今岂可自相鱼肉！俟吾北还，邃等自当迎于道左，君但观之。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9331,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六 (晉紀二十八) / 烈宗孝武皇帝中之上 / 太元十年 / 第 16 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a355c42f-db0e-11ef-ad91-a0d3651f611f","year_int":385},"tongjian_id":"a355c42f-db0e-11ef-ad91-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高邑","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_pe